@startuml
!theme cyborg
skinparam backgroundColor #111827
skinparam defaultFontColor #F3F4F6
title HISTORICAL broader-product proposal — Proposed logical trust boundaries — controls require actual evidence
skinparam backgroundColor #111827
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial

rectangle "Untrusted callers / clients\nBrowser, employer, native Git" as C #164E63
package "Trusted application coordination\nLogical module ownership is not OS isolation" {
 rectangle "Boundary validation + verified context" as V
 rectangle "Resource-owner authorization / invariants\nScoped adapters and durable attempts" as A
 V --> A
}
database "Private records / artifacts / Git\nExact identities + protected references" as S
rectangle "External providers\nUntrusted content + actual remote effects" as P
rectangle "Untrusted execution domain\nActual containment / resources / network gates" as E #164E63
rectangle "Privileged target domain\nSeparate trusted adapter and approval" as T #164E63
rectangle "Restricted recovery domain\nConsistent backup + usable key access" as B
C --> V : TB-01 requests / context
A --> S : TB-02 scoped state / protected serving
A <--> P : TB-03 capability / observation
A <--> E : TB-04 gated attempt / scoped evidence
A --> T : TB-05 exact approved target intent
S --> B : TB-06 protected consistent recovery set
note bottom of E
 No production secrets or host/admin interfaces.
 Job code cannot approve target deployment.
end note
note bottom of B
 Restore in isolation; reconcile current authority.
 No automatic external-action replay.
end note
@enduml
